9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853060/extras/da6f06f20c343fcddb4edc2963b5d07e.mp4?t=1740081816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades and enemies you encounter will redefine how the grid works</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Sigils to manipulate the grid, setting up devastating combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies with special attacks that alter the mechanics of the puzzle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853060/extras/1681d4014a78fd7475cda0760a483731.avif?t=1740081816\" width=620 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853060/extras/56be541447bcdcc74133dfa8b3afa3ab.poster.avif?t=1740081816\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853060/extras/56be541447bcdcc74133dfa8b3afa3ab.webm?t=1740081816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853060/extras/56be541447bcdcc74133dfa8b3afa3ab.mp4?t=1740081816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet colorful characters in random events that can be your saving grace or the final nail in your coffin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve brain tickling puzzles using the orbs you\u2019ve collected</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through ever-shifting maps to confront the  anomaly and restore peace to your dimension</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853060/extras/148cac63e6a6975a195359a5d461828d.avif?t=1740081816\" width=620 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
